<title>NETHERLANDS: Sales of Dutch 2007 bond raise NLG 4.7 bln so far.</title>
<headline>Sales of Dutch 2007 bond raise NLG 4.7 bln so far.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Finance Ministry said the government had raised 4.7 billion guilders so far through tap sales of its new 5.75 percent bond due February 2007.</p>
<p>Tap sales began on Monday and will continue daily from 0800 GMT until further notice.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
